us":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S008","kind":"main","cn":"我要热的。","meaning_my":"အပူပဲ လိုချင်တယ်။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S009","kind":"main","cn":"大杯多少钱？","meaning_my":"အကြီးခွက် ဘယ်လောက်လဲ။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S009_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"大杯二十八块。","meaning_my":"အကြီးခွက် ယွမ်နှစ်ဆယ့်ရှစ်ပါ။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S009_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S010","kind":"main","cn":"有小杯吗？","meaning_my":"အသေးခွက် ရှိလား။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S010_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"这款没有小杯。","meaning_my":"ဒီအမျိုးအစားက အသေးခွက် မရှိဘူး။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S010_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S011","kind":"main","cn":"大杯比中杯贵多少钱？","meaning_my":"အကြီးခွက်က အလတ်ခွက်ထက် ဘယ်လောက် ပိုဈေးကြီးလဲ။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S011_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"大杯加三块。","meaning_my":"အကြီးခွက်ဆို ယွမ်သုံးယွမ် ပိုပေးရတယ်။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S011_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S012","kind":"main","cn":"能换成大杯吗？","meaning_my":"အကြီးခွက် ပြောင်းပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S013","kind":"main","cn":"可以做温的吗？","meaning_my":"နွေးနွေးလေး လုပ်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S013_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"可以，要温一点对吧？","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ နွေးနွေးလေး လိုချင်တာနော်။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S013_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S014","kind":"main","cn":"这杯不要太烫。","meaning_my":"ဒီတစ်ခွက်ကို အရမ်းမပူအောင် လုပ်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S015","kind":"main","cn":"不要加太多冰。","meaning_my":"ရေခဲ အများကြီး မထည့်ပါနဲ့။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S015_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"冰少一点。","meaning_my":"ရေခဲ နည်းနည်း လျှော့ထည့်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S015_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S016","kind":"main","cn":"可以换燕麦奶吗？","meaning_my":"အုတ်ဂျုံနို့ ပြောင်းသုံးပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S016_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"可以，不过要另外加钱。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ ဒါပေမဲ့ ပိုက်ဆံ ထပ်ပေးရတယ်။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S016_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S016_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"能用燕麦奶代替牛奶吗？","meaning_my":"နွားနို့အစား အုတ်ဂျုံနို့ သုံးပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S016_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S017","kind":"main","cn":"换燕麦奶要加钱吗？","meaning_my":"အုတ်ဂျုံနို့ ပြောင်းရင် ပိုက်ဆံ ထပ်ပေးရလား။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S018","kind":"main","cn":"有豆奶吗？","meaning_my":"ပဲနို့ ရှိလား။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S019","kind":"main","cn":"我要热拿铁，不加糖。","meaning_my":"လာတေးအပူ တစ်ခွက် ပေးပါ၊ သကြား မထည့်ပါနဲ့။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S020","kind":"main","cn":"这款咖啡苦吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီကော်ဖီ ခါးလား။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S020_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"稍微有点苦。","meaning_my":"နည်းနည်းတော့ ခါးတယ်။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S020_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S021","kind":"main","cn":"可以加一份浓缩吗？","meaning_my":"အက်စပရက်ဆို တစ်ရှော့ ထပ်ထည့်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S022","kind":"main","cn":"可以做无咖啡因的吗？","meaning_my":"ကဖိန်းဓာတ်မပါတဲ့ ကော်ဖီ လုပ်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.06.01-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.01-S022_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我帮您确认一下有没有。","meaning_my":"ရှိမရှိ စစ်ပေးပါမယ်။",