့်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.06.02-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.02-S022","kind":"main","cn":"不要奶盖。","meaning_my":"နို့ခရင်မ်အမြှုပ်အလွှာ မထည့်ပါနဲ့။","audio_file":"04.06.02-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.02-S023","kind":"main","cn":"奶盖要另外加钱吗？","meaning_my":"နို့ခရင်မ်အမြှုပ် ထည့်ရင် ပိုက်ဆံ ထပ်ပေးရလား။","audio_file":"04.06.02-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.02-S023_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"要，奶盖另外收费。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်တယ်၊ နို့ခရင်မ်အမြှုပ် ထည့်ရင် ပိုက်ဆံ ထပ်ပေးရတယ်။","audio_file":"04.06.02-S023_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.02-S024","kind":"main","cn":"这杯要少糖少冰。","meaning_my":"ဒီတစ်ခွက်ကို အချိုလျှော့ပြီး ရေခဲလည်း လျှော့ထည့်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.06.02-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.02-S025","kind":"main","cn":"这杯要中杯的。","meaning_my":"ဒီတစ်ခွက်ကို အလတ်ခွက်နဲ့ လုပ်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"04.06.02-S025.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.02-S026","kind":"main","cn":"可以做成温的吗？","meaning_my":"နွေးနွေးလေး လုပ်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.06.02-S026.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.02-S026_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"这款只能做冰的。","meaning_my":"ဒီအမျိုးအစားက အအေးပဲ လုပ်လို့ရတယ်။","audio_file":"04.06.02-S026_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.03-S001","kind":"main","cn":"堂食还是外带？","meaning_my":"ဒီမှာသောက်မလား၊ ပါဆယ်ယူမလား။","audio_file":"04.06.03-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.03-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"外带，谢谢。","meaning_my":"ပါဆယ်ယူမယ်၊ ကျေးဇူးပါ။","audio_file":"04.06.03-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.03-S002","kind":"main","cn":"在这里喝。","meaning_my":"ဒီမှာပဲ သောက်မယ်။","audio_file":"04.06.03-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.03-S003","kind":"main","cn":"这杯带走。","meaning_my":"ဒီတစ်ခွက် ပါဆယ်ယူမယ်။","audio_file":"04.06.03-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.03-S003_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"这杯外带。"