y01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.03-S019","kind":"main","cn":"我点的是热的，不是冰的。","meaning_my":"အပူမှာထားတာပါ၊ အအေး မဟုတ်ဘူး။","audio_file":"04.06.03-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.03-S020","kind":"main","cn":"能帮我重新做一杯吗？","meaning_my":"တစ်ခွက် အသစ်ပြန်လုပ်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.06.03-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.03-S020_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我先确认一下订单。","meaning_my":"အော်ဒါကို အရင် စစ်ဆေးပေးပါမယ်။","audio_file":"04.06.03-S020_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.03-S021","kind":"main","cn":"外带袋子要收费吗？","meaning_my":"ပါဆယ်အိတ်ဖိုး ပေးရလား။","audio_file":"04.06.03-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"04.06.03-S022","kind":"main","cn":"杯盖能帮我盖紧点吗？","meaning_my":"ခွက်အဖုံးကို သေချာ တင်းတင်းပိတ်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"04.06.03-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"}]}
